67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f5a216b85599fbcdd76a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73238-1-7-2","ko":"나야 올해가 환갑이지.","zh":"我啊，今年就六十岁了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나야","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；야：强调或突出前面的对象，也可加强对比、条件等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해가","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"환갑이지.","meaning":"花甲","explanation":"환갑：花甲；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"환갑","audio":"/audio/d4aa3e1717471c653639.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73238","senseId":"1","lemma":"환갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"d4aa3e1717471c65","term":"환갑","zh":"花甲","audio":"/audio/d4aa3e1717471c653639.mp3","entryId":"73238","definition":"人出生后年满六十岁时的生日。","pronunciation":["환ː갑"]}],"audio":"/audio/441ce0da246ba31ae424.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.834,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73238","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":121,"sequenceScore":1.6607,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我啊，今年就六十